diagnostic_evidence.quote:
(\textit{Trust-region not used}) \,\,  $r_{n}\equiv \infty$ and the majorization gap $h_{n}^{(i)}$ satisfies the quadratic lower bound 
\begin{align}\label{eq:majorization_gap_lower_bd}
	h_{n}^{(i)}(\theta) \ge \frac{\rho}{2}\lVert \theta - \theta_{n-1}^{(i)} \rVert^{2} \quad \textup{for all $\theta\in \Theta^{(i)}$}
\end{align}
for some constant $\rho>0$.
